ProjectALife.DialogueShards["barks_panic_3"] = {
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"What was THAT?!","Did you hear that? Tell me you heard that, tell me I'm not-","My hands won't stay still.. somebody tell me what to do","Where's it coming from? Which way was that?","Was it that way? It was that way, no, THAT way!","Which way do we go, WHICH way, somebody pick one!","Away from it, go away from it, GO!","I'm listening for it again and I don't WANT to hear it again","Was that a gun?.. Tell me if you're only guessing","DOWN! I don't care what it was get down!","Is somebody shooting?.. Who would they shoot at?!","Down, down, get down, everybody down on the ground!","S-somebody's coming?.. How do we know they're coming to help?!","What if that was somebody screaming?.. Did you hear it like that?","Please don't let anybody be hurt.. please","Don't let it be a kid.. God please not a kid!!","Can't get that out of my head.. I can't make my head stop!","Did something blow up?.. Oh God what was that?!","I felt that in my stomach.. I want to be sick","Don't make me look.. I can hear enough without looking!","How bad's it gonna get?! Somebody tell me it can't get worse","Is there anybody out there who knows what to do?!","Hey!.. If you can hear me I need HELP!","Somebody come get me! Please COME GET ME!","Nobody go toward it.. please don't!","Please let nobody be hurt.. please let it just be NOISE!","Oh Lord, it's started here too","Don't go toward it.. please have a little sense!","I can't tell what I'm listening to.. just give me a second!","I'm NOT going out theeere, you can't make me!","I can feel my heart in my teeth!","Is it getting closer?.. I can't tell I can't TELL!","Get low!.. Low as you can!","Oh my Gaaaawd, oh my GOD!","I want it to be far away.. I want to be farther!","I want my mother.. I don't care how old I am I want my mother","Is there more than one thing out there?.. How do you TELL?!","What if that was a person? Somebody I know?","Every time I think I can stand this something else gets me","Right behind us?.. I can't tell where to look first!","I can hear my own heart.. hush a second PLEASE!","Don't move... don't make a sound... it'll pass, it has to pass","Do we go? Do we stay?","Get low NOW!!","Don't make me go closer.. I don't want a better look","Too much.. it's too damn much all at once!","Whoever's out there.. how do they stand it?!","Come here, stay where I can see you!","Shouldn't somebody be doing something?.. Why are we just HERE?!","Why is it so loud? It's never that loud on TV","Is it over? Don't say it's over if it's not over!","Dear God, what's going on out there, what is GOING ON!","Do we run?.. If I start running I don't know if I can stop!","I'm gonna count to ten and if it doesn't stop I'm gonna scream","I heard that, I heard it.. God, I can't stop shaking","Who turned the volume up on the whole world?","Run? Walk? Hide? Someone tell me which one!","I flinched so hard it hurts.. damn it","Lord.. don't let anybody I love be out there","Wait.. wait.. let me hear past my own breathing!","I want to shout for help.. no- what if the wrong thing hears?!","Nobody promised to come.. why'd I keep thinking somebody would?!","HEY!.. If somebody can hear me please HELP!","I can hear it in my chest, in my chest, in my stomach","Do we get down?.. Does somebody KNOW or are we all just guessing?!","Is it someone we know? It could be somebody we know","I want something between me and that.. anything!","Hey, did anybody call someone? Somebody has to have called!","That could be anything.. why can't I think of anything good?!","I wish I'd slept through all this.. I wish I could","I want somebody to tell me it's nothing.. I know they can't but I WANT it","Stay ready.. we might have to go before I can think"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Shhh, everybody stop, stop, listen","I don't like how that carries.. I don't like it at all","What if somebody needs help?.. I can't just go running out there","We're NOT going to look, whatever it is, it's got nothing to do with us","I can't stand waiting to hear what comes next","What if it brings them down on us?!","Is that the Army? Please say that's the Army?","I used to LIKE loud noises.. fireworks and all that.. not now","Never flinched when my daddy fired his rifle.. why can't I quit shaking now?","Wh-whatever that is.. please don't let it be after us","Tell me that was farther off than it sounded","My ears are ringing, or is that- no, that's me, that's just me!","I want to run but I don't know which way.. I don't KNOW","Used to hear the firehouse siren and know help was coming.. now what?!","I don't want to hear any more.. somebody please tell me what to do","Please tell me something.. anything.. I can't take this","Do we go help? Do we- ...no, we don't go, we don't","If somebody needs us how would we even get to them?!","I don't want to know how bad it is.. I DON'T!","I want to call out.. but what if it comes this way?!","Could it be the Army?.. Please let somebody come for us","Please.. don't leave me out here","I can't tell if it's one or a hundred, I can't tell","Is it outside?.. I can't work out where it's coming from","I keep trying to make sense of it.. I can't make any of it fit","Can't a person get a minute.. one damn minute without this?!","I'm gonna be sick, that was so loud...","I can't tell where it came from.. how am I supposed to get away?!","One more and I'm leaving, I'm out of here!","Was somebody shouting?.. Can anybody make out what that was?","That sounded like the next county, tell me it's the next county!","If that's help why am I still afraid to call out?!","We should hide, where do we hide!","Somebody's got to know what's going on, someone HAS to","Was that a bomb or a gun? I can't tell the difference","Shh.. please.. I need a second to listen","My eyes keep jumping at everything.. stop it just STOP it","I'm counting my breaths.. keep losing count damn it","I'm trying to stay on my feet.. don't let me fall","Quiet, quiet, wait for the next one so we know where it's from","Please don't tell me I'm safe.. not till you KNOW","Was someone calling for help? Did you hear it, somebody calling-","Stay with me.. don't leave me here listening to that alone!","Can somebody find out what's happening?.. Please!","I hate this, I hate not knowing, I hate it","I'd give anything for this to be a bad dream.. anything","Who has a gun? We need someone with a gun, who has a gun","I'm counting to a hundred, if there's no more by a hundred we go","We should've left yesterday, why didn't we leave yesterday","Please, God, let it be far","Keep quiet.. don't call out till we know who might hear","Please let it be over before I have to find out what it was","I've heard all sorts of things on TV.. none of it told me what to do!","Should I call out?.. What if somebody answers?!","I can't get that sound out of my head.. never gonna get it out","What if my sister's out there?.. Tell me she could still be all right","My heart won't slow down, it won't slow down, I can't make it slow down","Down behind the- behind something, anything, quick","I keep hearing things in that.. things I don't want to hear","Somebody ought to explain this.. what the hell am I meant to do?!","Wish I could hear my dog fussing.. just the old fussing he always did","I need a minute without this.. just one minute!","Please let that be the police.. please","I can't count anything.. can't even get my breathing right","I don't know what to do with my hands, what do I do with my hands?","Did anybody see anything?.. I don't want to be the one who looks","Every muscle's waiting for the next thing.. I can't make myself loosen up","Do I look?.. I don't want to look but I can't just stand here","Please tell me there's some ordinary reason for it.. please","I'll still hear that when I try to sleep.. I know I will","Everything's too loud, the whole county's too loud","You think somebody's coming?.. What if they're not coming for us?!","Maybe somebody could see us?.. Would they come get us?!","Did you catch any of that?.. My head just emptied","Please let it be rescue, please","If anybody's out there listening.. tell us what the hell's happening!","That's the loudest thing I ever heard in my entire life","Oh, I'm never gonna sleep again","What would you even shout?.. Help?.. Would anybody hear?!","What do they WANT, whoever's doing that?","Who does this?.. Why would anybody do this?!","Wait, wait, I know that sound, that's- no, I don't know it","I wanna get down and stay there.. don't care how long","It sounded like a war, it sounded like what the old guys talk about","I want quiet.. no I don't know what I want now!","Is anybody else as scared as me?.. Please say something","If I could call somebody.. who would I even call first?!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4",{"I don't know where to go.. I can't even pick a direction","Used to complain about hunters waking me.. I take it back ALL of it","Shoot, that was loud, shoot, sorry","Please help me hold still.. I can't quit shaking","Man, I just wanted to get my mail","I'd give my right arm to be somewhere I could shut my eyes","Hang on, hang on, let me just- one more, listen for one more","I keep telling myself easy.. it doesn't help worth a damn"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Don't go where I can't see you.. please!","I'm getting back to my people.. I don't care how far!","Come closer.. no I don't know what to do either!","Get down as low as you can.. DOWN!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=family|tmp=fresh|sex=m|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"I want my family with me.. I want to know they're all right"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=family,civilian|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"I wish my dog was here.. I wish I had somebody to hold on to"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Hold on to something! Cover your ears!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"They used to test that tornado siren.. I wish this was just a test","Hear anything else?.. I don't want to miss something"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4",{"Get low.. slow down a little don't lose your footing","That's more than I can take.. can we go now?","Don't talk for a second.. I want to hear what happens next","Give me a minute.. I can't get my bearings","Don't go looking.. nobody needs to go looking","Just wait.. give me ten minutes before you make me go anywhere","Heard it, don't need to hear it twice","One noise and I'm thinking the worst.. I can't help it"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"If that's a gun somebody ought to put it down!","Far enough?.. Is anything far enough now?","Hear that? Everybody in the county just found out at once","What if somebody out there's panicking?.. What if they're armed?!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Please don't try to be brave.. please just stay low"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_man|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Stay low.. I can't keep track of you if you go running off","I'll go look, no, I'm not going, I'm not, stay here with me!","Please don't call out.. not till we know who might answer!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_man|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I ought to know what to do.. just stay down while I think!","Anybody who can hear me keep low.. please!","Never heard anything that made me want to hide like this"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_man|day=0,4",{"I want to believe that's nowhere near my family.. I want to believe it"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_man|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Don't go anywhere.. no wait I don't know what's best!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_woman|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"I need to know my kids are all right.. I need to know","Don't go out of sight.. please stay where I can see you!","I want to cover my ears.. but what if I miss something?!","I can't breathe, I can't, it was so loud, it was SO loud..."}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_woman|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I keep thinking of my little girl.. what if she's hearing this too?!","Tell me what that was, I need somebody to tell me!","God I wish I knew where my mother was"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_woman|day=0,4",{"I keep thinking there's something I ought to switch off.. I can't think!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_elder|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"I heard worse in the war.. didn't think I'd be shaking like this again","Don't you worry about me, just get yourselves down, go on","What in the world!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_elder|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Nobody's too proud to get down.. not now!","Hush, listen, hush, let me hear it, my ears aren't what they were"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_elder|day=0,4",{"Used to know a sound before anyone else.. ears don't help me much now","I've heard guns my whole life.. this has me wanting to hide like a child"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_elder|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Lord I hope nobody's mama has to hear about this"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_youth|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Dude was that a gun?.. Don't just tell me what you think I wanna hear!","Whoa, that- no, that's not cool at all!","Is that the cops? Is it, are the cops shooting!","Hey! HEY!.. Somebody hear me please!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_youth|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I wanna go home.. I just wanna go home","If somebody needs help.. I'd just stand there wouldn't I?!","I wanna look, I wanna go look, no, I don't, I really don't..."}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=family_youth|day=0,4",{"Okay, that was like the loudest thing ever, my ears are gone!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_man|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Jesus, was that gunfire? That was gunfire, wasn't it","Get down behind something, move it, MOVE!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_man|day=0,4",{"I've never wanted to go back home this bad.. never"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_man|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Where do I go? I got no idea where to go, anyone know where to go","Could that mean help?.. God I don't know whether to shout or hide!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_man|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"I thought it was someone's bad idea of a joke, I guess not"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_woman|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Oh my God, was that a gun? Was that really a gun?","I keep hearing it in my head.. I want it OUT!","Which way is safe? Please just tell me which way?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_woman|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"I'm shaking, look at me shaking, I can't make it stop","I don't want to be out here, I want to be home, I want to go home"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_woman|day=0,4",{"Please let it be somebody looking for us.. please let somebody be looking"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_loner|day=0,4",{"Keep still a minute.. let your ears do the work","Don't know who, don't know where, I'd rather not find out","Go have a look if you're that curious.. I'll wait right here"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_loner|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Well, that's one way to ring the dinner bell","Louder than it ought to be, that's all I'm saying"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=civilian_loner|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Down, get down, no heroics, just stay down!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=worker|day=0,2",{"I used to jump when somebody dropped a tool.. this is a hell of a lot worse"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=worker|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Hell.. I want to go home I don't even care what's making it"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=worker|day=0,4|mood=angry",{"Can't even hear a noise without thinking I ought to fix something.. hell"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=worker|day=0,4",{"Nobody needs to go see what made it.. leave it alone","Used to know what needed fixing just by listening.. can't do that with this"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=worker|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Did you hear that?!.. I don't want to be the one going to look"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=worker|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"I knew something was off when the plant went quiet"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_firefighter|day=0,2",{"Don't go rushing in.. give me a moment before I go making things worse"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_firefighter|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"First thing I think is they'll call us.. who the hell's still calling?","Get low.. don't go toward it till we know what we're walking into"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_firefighter|day=0,4",{"Leave it alone.. nobody needs to get closer just to satisfy themselves","I want somebody to tell me what needs doing.. just tell me!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_firefighter|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Keep thinking the station will tell me what to do.. hell listen to me"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_medical|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Someone's gonna need me, I should go, no, I shouldn't go","Stay down.. please give me a second before you need me!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_medical|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"What if somebody needs me?.. I can't go till I can think straight","If that's somebody hurt.. no I can't start thinking like that"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_medical|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"I don't want to be needed for this.. God forgive me I don't"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_medical|day=0,4",{"Breathe, everybody breathe, in through the nose, slow"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_clergy|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Lord, be with whoever that was, be with them!","Peace, be still, everyone, please be still"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_clergy|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Let us pray, let- let us- I can't, I can't get the words out!","I should go see, they might need a pastor, but I can't, I can't move!","Dear Lord.. let somebody hear us let somebody COME!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_clergy|day=0,4",{"Down please.. the Lord can hear you down there too"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=rescue_clergy|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Thirty years of tent revivals and I never heard noise like that"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Shots fired, shots fired, all units","Heads down, get your heads down","Down, folks, everybody down, I've got you, DOWN!","Which way is it? Mullins, which way?","Who's shooting? Are WE shooting? Tell me that isn't us","My wife's out there, I need to get on the radio","Somebody screamed, did you hear that","That was big, that was real big, that's a gas line!","Get down get down get DOWN!","That one was right on top of us, did anyone see where it came from?","Folks! Get inside, go on, inside, stay there!","Ma'am, ma'am, get down, get your kids down!","Don't fire, nobody fire, we're the good guys!!","Call the armory, tell them we need the Guard, tell them NOW!","That's from the supermarket, that came from the supermarket!","Those are screams, those are people screaming, a LOT of people!","Holy God, was that a- that was a cannon, wasn't it?","Mullins, down, DOWN, I've got you!","Hold your fire! Hold fire! Don't answer it!","Get that woman down, get her DOWN, ma'am, down!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_deputy,law_officer,law_trooper|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Dispatch, I've got shots, location unknown","10-33, 10-33, I'm hearing automatic fire, say again, AUTOMATIC fire"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_deputy,law_officer,law_trooper|day=0,4",{"Dispatch, I need a twenty on that gunfire","All units, be advised, multiple shots, I can't give you a number","Any unit, any unit, anyone out toward Rosewood?","Unit 9, what's your twenty? Unit 9?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_deputy,law_officer,law_trooper|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Radio's jammed, everybody's talking at once, one at a time, ONE at a time!","Control, say again, I couldn't hear you over the shooting","Who's running Code 3 out there? Who IS that?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_deputy,law_officer,law_trooper|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Dispatch, there's a siren I can't account for, is that ours?","That siren isn't ours, I don't know whose it is"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4",{"Everybody get low, get behind something solid","Pruitt, cover left, I've got right","No one goes to see, nobody, it could be anything","Stay with me, we go back toward the station, slow","Civilians behind us, all of them, back","Hold your position, I don't know what's out there, hold","Where's it coming from? Give me a direction, any direction","I heard shooting, and now I'm waiting for the next sound","Wait, wait, listen, I want to hear it again before we move","Hurry up, get inside the station, hurry","Hatcher, take the east side, I'll take the west","Unit 14, Unit 14, give me a status, one word","I'd say half a mile, maybe less, hard to tell"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Don't run toward it, we move away, calm, we move AWAY","I know that sound, that's a twelve gauge, that's a shotgun","That's military, I know that rhythm, that's an M-16","I can't tell if it's one guy or a whole army","What's the Guard doing, are they firing, why's the Guard firing?","All right, all right, I hear it, easy, easy...","With that echo you can't tell a thing, not a thing","That's a woman, we have to go, no, we can't go, hold","There's gonna be fire, get the fire department on- oh, right!","That's a Huey, that's an Army Huey, they're finally here!","Wave it down, flash something, hand me the- here, here...","Sirens in every direction, which one are we supposed to follow?","I thought I was ready, I trained for this, nobody trained for THIS","Another one, there's another one, that's two guns, maybe three","Hear that? The dogs just all started at once","I count three shooters, no, two, I can't tell","It was a scream, wasn't it? Tell me it was a scream","Anybody on channel two? Channel two? Anyone?","Glass breaking, I hear glass, a lot of glass","Dispatch hasn't answered in fifteen minutes, fifteen","Get low and listen, tell me how many different guns","Where are the shots going? Who are they AIMED at?","Run toward the shooting? Is that what the job says? Because it's not what I want","The sirens are all wrong, they're going the wrong direction","Another one, a third one, there's three of them out there...","Wait, listen, there it is again, that's pistols, a lot of pistols","My ears are shot, I can't tell where it's coming from..."}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"Someone's shooting at somebody and it isn't us, which is something","That's a deer rifle, who's hunting a deer in July","Ten years on the job and I've never walked toward gunfire this slow","Breathe, you've been shot at before, breathe","No one told me it would sound like that out here","It's not stopping, they're just flying over","They're headed for the fort, they're heading for Knox","It's quiet now, I don't like quiet now","Wasn't anything on the schedule for today, nothing like this","When the radio goes quiet in the middle of all that, that's when I worry","That's a thirty-ought, that's not one of ours","I've been in two shootings and both times I could see the guy","You hear that? Nobody's in charge out there, nobody at all","I'll bet you every cent I've got that's the Guard"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|day=0,2",{"Everybody calm and down, that's an order","Nobody answers that fire, nobody, we don't know who it is!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|day=0,4",{"Pruitt, go to the radio, Hatcher, keep eyes on the east side","No one returns fire at anything until we know what it is","We hold here, we're not going toward that noise","Get those folks in a group and keep them down","Get me a map, I want to know what's out that way"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"I don't like not knowing who's firing, I don't like that at all","Count the shots for me, how many, how far, give me something","We've never had this much gunfire in this county, never"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_sheriff,law_sergeant|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"That was close, a lot closer than it should be..."}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Shots! Can you tell where they're coming from?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|day=0,4",{"Down, down, move to cover, I've got the lane","Who's shooting? Are we taking fire? Say again, are we taking fire","Hold, hold, we don't know who's friendly out there","Sector clear, no visual, say again, no visual"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Confirm, that's not us, I repeat, that is NOT us","Multiple weapons, multiple positions, I can't call it"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=swat_lead,swat_operator|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"We're not the only ones armed in this county anymore"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=swat_lead|day=0,4",{"Operators, check your sectors, call it, left, right, rear"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=swat_operator|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Team lead, are we fighting back? Do we fight back?"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_corrections|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"That's coming from the direction of the jail, hell, that's coming from the jail"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","role=law_corrections|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Lock it down, lock it all down, that's gunfire","I heard shots. Can't tell where from"}},
