{"PANIC_DAY_GUNFIRE","reg=military,elite|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Shots! Shots out there, everyone down!","Was that a scream? Did anybody else hear a scream?","Get away from the fuel, NOW!!","Is that a friendly chopper? Tell me that's a friendly!","Sir, someone's screaming out there!","Blue on blue! Check fire!","Rack a round, don't fire, hold","Sniper somewhere, get your heads down!","That one hit the building, that hit the BUILDING!"}},
